<h2 local-id=3D"a201347a-ada7-45d9-b743-28784be2b3f6" id=3D"Stage3-Semi-Aut=
oResponseGenerationNoticeIQ-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-1.ExecutiveSummary"=
><strong>1. Executive Summary</strong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"6f9af26c-0c32-47d9-a3b2-5448d6f37264">The Semi-Auto Response=
 Generation will extract the relevant information from the case details to =
pre-fill the relevant sections in the correspondence letter for Notice IQ c=
lients and then once checked, will get sent out.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"6ddc9668-4f03-4368-9d6f-7e5babd728c6" id=3D"Stage3-Semi-Aut=
oResponseGenerationNoticeIQ-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-2.BusinessObjective=
s"><strong>2. Business Objectives</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"e5353649-15d2-4139-8d7d-ecc544bf8f21">
<li local-id=3D"083cbdca-650f-4036-bedf-a54411986c14">
<p local-id=3D"f225d489-7a09-4bbd-b736-997f1337baab">Reduce the time taken =
to write up the correspondence.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"18a49e86-3f3e-4d3d-8391-2ed92e3b6e67">
<p local-id=3D"1a882aab-33d0-4b21-adfe-8fbb2ba7f9a9">Ensure that the key in=
formation is captured from the summarisation and link it to the correct and=
 accurate correspondence templates and then add these into the letter.</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"03b496bf-c836-4f7c-8a52-43d6a0b5f32c">
<p local-id=3D"c4e75bf7-9fa3-47e6-95ed-945281e3ff66">Enable seamless integr=
ation with Notice IQ portal.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bec43e149d44">
<p local-id=3D"2328690c45e3">We want to see an automated complete letter an=
d an action required letter.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e437d664fa9c">
<p local-id=3D"9f09aef4c6c4">In the agent workflow we want to show a column=
 with the title =E2=80=98letter generation=E2=80=99 that highlights the cas=
es that are completed by the AI and cases that the AI cannot complete.</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"e570a9668402">
<p local-id=3D"f197ce83e48c">Want the cases that need manual changes from a=
n agent to be identified so the QA=E2=80=99s can perform quality checks on =
these cases.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eda8de1e-ae71-4a29-b709-f59eee9d2f45">
<p local-id=3D"0246ead2-8102-4244-b853-c0498d30700d">Maintain complete audi=
t logs for compliance.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"19f3a042-db83-44f7-ba91-757afc6518a0" id=3D"Stage3-Semi-Aut=
oResponseGenerationNoticeIQ-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-3.Background&amp;Bu=
sinessContext"><strong>3. Background &amp; Business Context</strong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"c6e4c84f-43e5-45ab-be41-32913418d798"><strong>Current State =
(As-Is):</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"7b2de609-2f70-4318-8209-d250b7ffb167">
<li local-id=3D"b192cecd-6ac0-4700-b4ba-7555ce2e4590">
<p local-id=3D"e71f156e-aebc-4fab-80b4-6a0b00c0c48b">Agent must fill out th=
e reason, sub reason and answer questions for each sub reason manually.</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"ea555ffa-3cbc-4d99-aa7f-11d6f96f3bbd">
<p local-id=3D"929dbe67-447d-4a30-a3d8-ce445b16454c">Agent must downloads t=
he letter template from the CRM.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dad5a981-35de-4393-9a13-1275425c7e15">
<p local-id=3D"1abcf5d2-d24f-4e0b-aca0-c9fbf0d5fa58">Agent must manually co=
py the relevant template paragraphs from AIRA into the downloaded letter an=
d then upload the letter.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"f4363d90-4b42-4afb-a2d1-38a941516b18"><strong>Future State (=
To-Be):</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"84d2f300-dbf7-4ad3-8920-ca0fd009f9e8">
<li local-id=3D"a203bbb2-d556-490a-9db1-2233395a846a">
<p local-id=3D"e2784ee5020b">Information from case validation, citizen evid=
ence, previous letter history, permit/Ringo check, council rules, stage of =
PCN and amount outstanding is automatically captured and pre fills the answ=
ers to the questions to form a suggested letter to the customer.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"563b7bb2-7c3b-4d55-974a-2372a4550200">
<p local-id=3D"79a828773bbc">The agent checks the suggested letter and if n=
ecessary makes any changes to form the final letter.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c34773c6-4814-47d0-8a45-1aedbd316b12">
<p local-id=3D"a777e8d1-d38d-4c7d-9a63-706aa0fc6910">Once the letter is che=
cked the agent the clicks send.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"0bef1a06-15d6-49a6-ac86-0c90d8be28e6" id=3D"Stage3-Semi-Aut=
oResponseGenerationNoticeIQ-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-4.Scope"><strong>4.=
 Scope</strong></h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"d125f50d-9f28-4e71-99ba-247397523c09" id=3D"Stage3-Semi-Aut=
oResponseGenerationNoticeIQ-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-InScope"><strong>In=
 Scope</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"3a25c00b-c73f-474f-a1ab-8a8fe1df18c7">
<li local-id=3D"67d7267e-53ef-4e32-8167-411e85694d93">
<p local-id=3D"6f3cb43d-cf44-4c4f-bc9b-7444905a6a02">Pre fill the details f=
rom the PCN case validation (Stage 2 output) into the correspondence letter=
 per council.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9c0a310f-b130-4e73-a0ea-7fb689d2cfa2">
<p local-id=3D"fe497e91-fd58-437d-82fa-6f847d1bf2f5">Notice IQ Councils - B=
racknell Forest, Hertfordshire, Surrey, Wokingham.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"b9a8ae39-a8a1-4816-8cc0-3dc09a605eb9" id=3D"Stage3-Semi-Aut=
oResponseGenerationNoticeIQ-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-OutofScope"><strong=
>Out of Scope</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"a53744f7-5069-4a63-b28a-cd10c56270be">
<li local-id=3D"7c1ae7a9-e6f5-40c6-840c-d7c2e326c331">
<p local-id=3D"7a7af5f1-9cd3-4ab8-b38e-445d3b90ed8d">PCN challenges outside=
 Notice IQ systems.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c09aa544-eb66-4aa6-a010-42e12092894f">
<p local-id=3D"a65647f5-10e1-43a3-a82b-844b5027ad54">Third-party CRMs.</p><=
/li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"fd75d40a-b141-4660-9d7a-ce95ce9046e5" id=3D"Stage3-Semi-Aut=
oResponseGenerationNoticeIQ-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-5.High-LevelBusines=
sRequirements"><strong>5. High-Level Business Requirements</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"2de7c0b0-f684-4146-950e-c000af9959a5" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 124.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 1675.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"35bb030c-cb65-4bd1-913d-6fe2dce5b4f6">
<th data-local-id=3D"92b02d8e-6b22-4f1d-a96f-baf0e5dfddfa" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0cbf4ca7-6746-43a3-9235-e915611a73e2"><strong>ID</strong></p=
></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"935d630f-0044-4155-943a-7cc574e3eb06" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"af321a17-4196-47ee-b7db-b834210d8c65"><strong>Requirements</=
strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"69a31cb3-f4b5-40e7-a274-837d6feda563">
<td data-local-id=3D"9a5b1fa7-df20-46de-b03a-0610a61b21fa" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b4d2ea22-42d3-45e3-94aa-ee9d7e92e4aa">BR-01</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b071a667-e60c-455d-b1fe-64ed712364b5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"14a8b3c1-3e6e-45ca-a0d2-f84d6011a4e4">The tool should pre fi=
ll the details from the PCN case validation (Stage 2 output), the contraven=
tion location and previous history of all the PCNs that have been cancelled=
 into the correspondence letter per council.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d3ebb099bff0">
<td data-local-id=3D"179281c6-28b4-4089-b64a-194e2bb27503" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bf88db9a7ef0">BR-02</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"adea6b9f9dd6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"65104ccc4281">Information from Stage 2 (Validation) should b=
e used to prefill the letter automatically based on the reasons for the cha=
llenge and mitigations from the customer.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"978e09a75341">
<td data-local-id=3D"14408e4a-5d28-4879-b2e5-2452aa7416f5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"42a385a1a56a">BR-03</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"53a27113e1bc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"11762d5a22d9">The tool should identify and highlight the cas=
es where the AI cannot complete the letter.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9677318fc161">
<td data-local-id=3D"20e5a71bfe46" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"80e5080fa87f">BR-04</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1b30cadd8b58" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a32b5e9f6fff">The agent should be able to make changes to a =
case before completing the letter.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"dd24d1cd-5db7-4fff-875b-93164f168d52">
<td data-local-id=3D"474af6b9-cad2-4b54-ab00-ae018d76b6ad" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9dc9a492-174a-4ca6-bff4-41ccd841c295">BR-05</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"eb3bec94-1547-4fec-8d74-9cbc9bed96f4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f51b9e38cfdc">The agent should be able to edit the content w=
ithin the letter template.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a890b877-fdca-4b5f-9389-b8c5ea444152">
<td data-local-id=3D"47c5d60b-5987-4b81-a882-8aa5053f8e84" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3be39300-5a94-4247-b962-0e6bb5ff12af">BR-06</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9f8d6cda-681b-4054-89e8-a80d1076e6b6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c4d2db51aa4d">If the AI generated letter covers everything (=
Green) then the agent reviews it and clicks complete and follows the curren=
t process in Notice IQ.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"701b37ec3a8d">
<td data-local-id=3D"b4f21aac-35e8-4718-b87f-1cd6e00740da" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0b45409acb5d">BR-07</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"77c2152d-d6e6-4fd5-8bcc-af38f0efe7d0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1730c3c51c0d">The tool needs to identify if an agent has mad=
e an amendment (Amber and Red) to the letter templates and these are automa=
tically added to a queue for the QAs to check based on the current settings=
 held in Notice IQ that dictates, by agent, the percentage of letters to be=
 checked by the QA.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7c4f436f-4427-4b98-add7-748e1d9029a9">
<td data-local-id=3D"01c27596-1945-4598-b5d6-129b0d4c44c0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"44685aed3741">BR-08</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"479ee5e1-4c51-4a2b-93fa-3f3ec639cd42" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ddc95c440933">If content is added or deleted to a letter tem=
plate by the agent, the amendments needs to be highlighted for the QA to re=
view.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"38828e44-ec52-4a3b-b68a-edc8fd8005b9">
<td data-local-id=3D"833d3467-7fda-4a71-90bc-3233ad391eef" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6eb166ff0a86">BR-09</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9f41af45-8ae7-414b-84f3-b5e0aa8e293d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a249f1dd85ae">When a QA sends the letter back with the notes=
 attached on the case, the agent should be able to make the changes before =
sending the letter to the queue for the QA to review as is the current proc=
ess in Notice IQ.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f95e03d7c39d">
<td data-local-id=3D"d20e653c-bd8d-42d1-b63b-cb45513ea829" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"02cbf8157457">BR-10</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ab7eee9a-3e98-4e4e-8100-2b6d3c3ff09f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2f6838534bd9">To create a dashboard covering all of the anal=
ysis of the data from the tool and we want this delivered at the same time =
as the solution.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bad07be419a4">
<td data-local-id=3D"ae6c251ae04f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2139af8dabb4">BR-11</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b244b81ee93c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4196ed791afd">The business to be able to make any changes to=
 the Knowledge Source + document and LV to upload the updated knowledge sou=
rce + document to live within 24 hours.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"36816ee933f4">
<td data-local-id=3D"7dae864a76b0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1337587a175e">BR-12</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8581b671e471" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"49f09f4fe830">The solution shall deliver a streamlined and u=
ser-friendly agent experience, minimising interaction effort and ensuring c=
larity of task expectations.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"188e6c7a55d8">
<td data-local-id=3D"63071b4ed733" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"01f692696fd2">BR-13</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c03d9337cc28" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c3840122a22a">A QR code printed on the letter for the custom=
er to be able to scan.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
