<h2 local-id=3D"4a3b3be8-f408-44b9-a29c-de6d3c7858ce" id=3D"Stage3-Semi-Aut=
oResponseGenerationNoticeIQ-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-7.Assumptions"><str=
ong>7. Assumptions</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"7b98914a-3c1f-4196-8ef0-d6832579ad9e">
<li local-id=3D"3054b3ef-f375-455e-a80a-d1b92bbabb4f">
<p local-id=3D"d48019d3-5ded-41e0-84fb-4923ffc08079">Council policy documen=
ts are accessible and up to date.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f0a16051-6b16-4132-809b-54f958840c4a">
<p local-id=3D"5854412b-0da5-44f3-8a46-c35a1aed3fa0">Agents trained on revi=
ewing the letter before it gets sent out.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"20b0642f176c">
<p local-id=3D"6b3cd02c6d6f">The current processes and progressions after a=
 letter is completed remain the same as the processes we do today.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"6d40ed5f-b55f-4362-bb21-bccc46ee5e23" id=3D"Stage3-Semi-Aut=
oResponseGenerationNoticeIQ-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-8.Constraints"><str=
ong>8. Constraints</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"a5209110-1729-4420-9a84-5b302b41cee4">
<li local-id=3D"0df7901f-1e67-4dc0-9d1d-491b55f4b43b">
<p local-id=3D"f1ae5975-2cfa-416c-94dd-fbc5b6d71859">Limited to Notice IQ c=
ontracts.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0fdda903-b606-4831-a4c5-27fe4e7d9f03">
<p local-id=3D"82d6b0f4-751e-48f0-8020-eedb1edd0e03">Dependent on council d=
ocumentation accuracy.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8bfec67c-c553-447e-889a-257fb4a3c8a7">
<p local-id=3D"b2f9b378-4464-4fca-84b4-6e4a45440e3a">GDPR compliance requir=
ed.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"50338071-9518-4599-865e-01f417e03b8d" id=3D"Stage3-Semi-Aut=
oResponseGenerationNoticeIQ-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-9.Risks"><strong>9.=
 Risks</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"1db14596-0903-4a92-8fd3-4b31e7734322">
<li local-id=3D"c8d49bd3-b576-4367-bcea-2bed79d4ab58">
<p local-id=3D"0f4416ed-c3a8-4084-bd01-ed32b8dfa35a">Poor policy document q=
uality may impact accuracy.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bf27ac03-9d18-40d4-8aaf-aa56cd10c94c">
<p local-id=3D"8e3387c6-8e97-4dc2-a13e-2a43559dc696">Potential agent resist=
ance to automation.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"46683012-1374-4186-9d59-d805af683ea6" id=3D"Stage3-Semi-Aut=
oResponseGenerationNoticeIQ-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-10.Dependencies"><s=
trong>10. Dependencies</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"99a4ebf0-ddab-4e19-b4d0-e479f6ed57e6">
<li local-id=3D"df71bfce-67d3-4aa9-a2c4-dad809e94f00">
<p local-id=3D"66daf4e7-63d7-4ea9-aab6-b71560528f29"><strong>Stage 3 Tool I=
ntegration</strong> -The bot depends on the stage 3 tool being available fo=
r retrieving the PCN case validation (Stage 2 output) into the corresponden=
ce letter.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"39f5dd8b-277a-478b-b57e-0d4480ed5140">
<p local-id=3D"8fe4a5ae-e0ce-4342-827f-2781f92ecc94"><strong>Council Policy=
 Documents</strong>-Validation accuracy depends on each council maintaining=
 and providing their up-to-date policy documents.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4fe1c27c-ffb6-4864-89ea-193b37430840">
<p local-id=3D"f37c4e64-3a40-415c-8ad9-b646c9e17af1"><strong>MNPS Portal Ac=
cess</strong>-Agents must access the tool only through the Notice IQ back-o=
ffice portal, any downtime impacts adoption.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"858e7e4d-4901-40f1-9c51-b5a7222e9ccb">
<p local-id=3D"392b0fab-3bdf-4107-a21a-3e293f361e09"><strong>User Training<=
/strong>-Processing agents must be trained on reviewing flagged mismatches =
and summaries.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"c038ead1-cb92-4a6f-b7fc-850ca7cdb89e" id=3D"Stage3-Semi-Aut=
oResponseGenerationNoticeIQ-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-11.SuccessCriteria"=
><strong>11. Success Criteria</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"daad51d6-f68e-4048-a717-2f497d49d72d">
<li local-id=3D"1e744ba0-2f56-4a73-aab2-efb04d25621c">
<p local-id=3D"40e9ef0d-9488-428c-b742-c683b6db7500">The tool can complete =
the majority of letters automatically (either fully or partially), with lit=
tle adaption from the agents.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f3688587-a690-438a-af55-0114f2f11057">
<p local-id=3D"8efdf30d-7008-4bf4-b925-633a2bc97de0">Positive agent feedbac=
k on usability.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1ffef944-90b8-443d-a6d1-429b34acc4f0">
<p local-id=3D"485f4128-be35-4eec-94e2-578934438df8">100% audit trail of va=
lidation outcomes.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"cd3d3031-8d54-4d4d-aaec-6c8e30125ab6" id=3D"Stage3-Semi-Aut=
oResponseGenerationNoticeIQ-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-12.KeyMilestones"><=
strong>12. Key Milestones</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"781280c6-2d5c-4d47-990f-3954202000e6">
<li local-id=3D"0a1d237b-dd2d-417d-9c0a-813446d5274d">
<p local-id=3D"710c97f5-d482-46a7-9b3c-e61a4a7c2814">Business requirements =
sign-off.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bd70a0c2-ad01-4476-b868-e70fa167d450">
<p local-id=3D"f8a1a403-b047-4252-9149-e712b70b4e97">Prototype delivery.</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"b4ae40ae-3b98-4d8f-a943-971b079ada0d">
<p local-id=3D"0f55fa37-ce23-422a-9f57-bf1ce078b791">UAT completion.</p></l=
i>
